#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libevdev.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libevdev"
msgstr "Instalação do libevdev"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libevdev.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libevdev</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libevdev</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libevdev.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX    \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Ddocumentation=disabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX    \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Ddocumentation=disabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libevdev.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The regression tests can be run as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user with <command>ninja "
"test</command>, in a graphical session. You need to have enabled the "
"CONFIG_INPUT_UINPUT setting in the kernel for full test coverage.  If it is "
"enabled as a module, the module is named <command>uinput</command> and needs"
" to be loaded before running the tests. Note that on some systems, the tests"
" may cause a hard lockup and require a reboot. On laptops, the system will "
"go into Sleep and need to be woken up to finish the test suites."
msgstr ""
"Os testes de regressão podem ser executados como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, com <command>ninja test</command>, em"
" uma sessão gráfica. Você precisa ter habilitado a configuração "
"CONFIG_INPUT_UINPUT no núcleo para cobertura completa do teste. Se estiver "
"habilitado como um módulo, o módulo será chamado <command>uinput</command> e"
" precisa ser carregado antes de se executar os testes. Observe que, em "
"alguns sistemas, os testes possivelmente causem um travamento total e exijam"
" uma reinicialização. Em laptops, o sistema entrará em suspensão e precisará"
" ser despertado para finalizar as suítes de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libevdev.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libevdev.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

